From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TEX8 Monero Patch Integrator <monero-patches@tex8.local>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wallet: bound public distribution transport recovery

Retry only typed incomplete public RPC transport operations, at most once
inside the original job deadline. Preserve exact proxy/auth/TLS binding.
Malformed payloads, bounds, chain identity, payment, and cancellation remain
fail closed. Report only a fixed job-owned failure stage to send callers.
Keep the existing per-read and connection time limits unchanged.

---
diff --git a/src/wallet/rct_distribution_cache.h b/src/wallet/rct_distribution_cache.h
